# Shared keepalive policy for all hosts — dead link is torn down in
# 15 x 3 = 45s. ServerAlive (encrypted) is the mechanism; TCPKeepAlive
# stays off (coarse and spoofable).
Host *
  ServerAliveInterval 15
  ServerAliveCountMax 3
  TCPKeepAlive no
